cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  pyTomoAO: tomographic reconstruction for adaptive optics
message: >-
  If you use this software in your research, please cite it
  using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Jacob
    family-names: Taylor
